  "body": "I noticed that Riot wasn't showing mentions of my display name `{ Adam }` in the notifications tab, so I investigated. Turns out the `/_matrix/client/unstable/notifications` only returns places where my username `@abeckmeyer:matrix.org` was in a message body or old events from when my display name was `Adam`. I'm assuming this is some sort of issue with having the characters `{` and `}` in my display name.\r\n\r\nI can provide the json from the request to `/_matrix/client/unstable/notifications`, but I'll need to take a closer look to see if anything needs to be redacted.",
